{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Willdros, in the evening, and specifically Sunday evening). To continue the account! From the Castle Hill there is a view over the entire valley of Töplitz — a valley between two mountain ranges — one being the mountains that separate Saxony from Bohemia, and a second range to the south of it, between which lies a valley three to four hours wide — Töplitz in the middle — the Nollendorf Church on the height, Kulm, Marienschein (you are meant by this), at the foot of the first range — Aussig lies in the corner by the Elbe, between the range towards the east — (the boys should look at the map of the Seven Years' War). Then I still took a walk around Töplitz — finally went to the theatre, a few acts of Preciosa — an even more delicate Zierlisel than the one you so titled in Berlin."}}],"created":1795219106,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":190,"prompt_tokens":269,"total_tokens":459,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-T36waVdzlg9ZfgvqLFMltUVRs0aE2AmK","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":269,"prompt_ms":517.312,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.923092936802974,"prompt_per_second":519.995669924533,"predicted_n":190,"predicted_ms":4476.112,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.683132275132277,"predicted_per_second":42.22414452542743}}